 - Local and VPS Docker stacks with a `bin/pf` controller (`up`, `down`, `logs`, `doctor`, `deploy`, `smoke`, `shell`) and a GitHub Actions deploy-dev workflow to the VPS ([#8](https://github.com/PegaFila/PegaFilaWeb/pull/8), [#9](https://github.com/PegaFila/PegaFilaWeb/pull/9), [#10](https://github.com/PegaFila/PegaFilaWeb/pull/10), [#11](https://github.com/PegaFila/PegaFilaWeb/pull/11), [#12](https://github.com/PegaFila/PegaFilaWeb/pull/12)).
 - CI: Pest test gate on PRs/push via `bin/pf shell` ([#21](https://github.com/PegaFila/PegaFilaWeb/pull/21)).
 - Editor/agent LSP support: Intelephense (general PHP) and first-party Laravel LSP (routes, views/Blade, config, Livewire) wired via `opencode.json`, shared `.claude/settings.json`, and `.vscode/` workspace settings ([#25](https://github.com/PegaFila/PegaFilaWeb/pull/25)).
